  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/160919119/0.160.0</id>
    <updated>2026-10-22T16:54:31Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/fastapi/fastapi/releases/tag/0.160.0"/>
    <title>0.160.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Query, header, cookie, and form parameter models now apply their &lt;code&gt;extra&lt;/code&gt; configuration to all submitted fields in the same parameter location, consistent with Pydantic behavior. This includes fields declared in other models, individual parameters, or dependencies, which were previously excluded.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;code&gt;extra=&quot;forbid&quot;&lt;/code&gt;, fields outside the model are rejected even if another parameter declares them. With &lt;code&gt;extra=&quot;allow&quot;&lt;/code&gt;, those fields are included as model extras. With the default &lt;code&gt;extra=&quot;ignore&quot;&lt;/code&gt;, they are ignored.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🐛 Apply each parameter model&#39;s &lt;code&gt;extra&lt;/code&gt; configuration to sibling fields. PR &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/fastapi/fastapi/pull/16594&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/fastapi/fastapi/pull/16594/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16594&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/tiangolo&quot;&gt;@tiangolo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Internal&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⬆ Bump certifi from 2026.1.4 to 2026.10.19. PR &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/fastapi/fastapi/pull/16571&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/fastapi/fastapi/pull/16571/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16571&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apps/dependabot&quot;&gt;@dependabot[bot]&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
